605
00:42:02.654 --> 00:42:03.920
Three.

606
00:42:03.955 --> 00:42:05.522
Two boys and a girl.

607
00:42:05.557 --> 00:42:08.424
Then you... you can imagine
what it might be like

608
00:42:08.460 --> 00:42:10.204
