704
00:47:36.421 --> 00:47:38.821
Drugs. guilt.

705
00:47:38.857 --> 00:47:41.190
Something is not right.

706
00:47:42.660 --> 00:47:44.627
Can I make a copy?

707
00:47:44.662 --> 00:47:46.796
Yeah.

708
00:47:48.633 --> 00:47:51.133
Mom. it's me. Jenny.

709
00:47:57.976 --> 00:47:59.976
