714
00:48:18.663 --> 00:48:21.097
I didn't mean it.

715
00:48:21.132 --> 00:48:25.301
I'm sorry. too.
and I didn't mean it either.

716
00:48:25.336 --> 00:48:28.604
I was just trying
to keep you safe.

717
