- Rebecca Miller.

731
00:49:29.500 --> 00:49:32.134
She went missing
about 18 months ago.

732
00:49:32.170 --> 00:49:33.602
Another girl around Jenny's age

733
00:49:33.638 --> 00:49:35.115
